---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/navigation/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/navigation/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Macon Me Hungry | Our Story" description="Learn about the origins of Macon Me Hungry, founder Jacob Thompson, and our partnership with Mercury Media Partners.">
  <Navbar lang="en" />
  
  <main class="bg-background pt-24 pb-20 min-h-screen">
    <div class="container max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
      <header class="mb-12 text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display text-foreground mb-4">About Us</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground">The story behind Macon's premier local food directory.</p>
      </header>

      <article class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert prose-headings:font-display mx-auto">
        <div class="bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-10 shadow-sm">
          <h2 class="text-2xl mt-0 mb-4 text-primary">Our Roots in Macon</h2>
          <p class="text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Macon Me Hungry was born out of a lifelong love for Middle Georgia. Our founder, <strong>Jacob Thompson</strong>, is a proud Macon native whose entire family calls this city home. Growing up surrounded by the rich culinary traditions and vibrant communities of Macon, Jacob always felt there was a need for a modern, dedicated platform to celebrate the city's incredible food scene.
          </p>
          <p class="text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed">
            From historic soul food joints to the booming downtown brewery scene, Macon Me Hungry is Jacob's love letter to his hometown—a curated guide designed to help locals and visitors alike discover the absolute best bites Macon has to offer.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2 class="text-2xl mt-0 mb-4 text-primary">Partnering with Mercury Media Partners</h2>
          <p class="text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            To bring this vision to life and ensure the platform is accessible, fast, and beautifully designed, Macon Me Hungry has proudly partnered with <strong>Mercury Media Partners</strong>.
          </p>
          <p class="text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed">
            Mercury Media Partners holds a special soft spot for showcasing independent businesses and local entrepreneurs. Their expertise in digital stewardship, ADA compliance, and modern web architecture guarantees that the amazing restaurants listed on Macon Me Hungry get the premium digital exposure they deserve, without being drowned out by generic, corporate directories.
          </p>
          <p class="text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed font-semibold">
            Together, we are on a mission to put Macon's local businesses on the map.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
  
  <Footer lang="en" />
</Layout>
